What this licence does not cover

The MIT licence above applies to the code in this repository. It does not
apply to the following, which are Copyright (c) 2026 Nikita Pietrow, all
rights reserved:

- the articles and their images in src/content/
- the written text of the site's pages, such as the home page and About page
  copy in src/pages/ and src/data/author.ts
- the Practically Digital name and wordmark, public/favicon.svg and
  public/og-default.png

You may reuse the page templates and components, but replace the text,
name and images with your own. You're welcome to link to the articles and
quote short extracts with credit and a link. For anything else, get in touch
using the contact details on the site's About page.

